{"module":"/assets/explain/method/method-substitution.js","part":"figure","scope":"method-substitution","title":"把完整分母换成新元，条件变成定和","note":"例：正数 $m,n$ 满足 $2m+n=6$，求 $\\frac1{2m+1}+\\frac1{n+1}$ 的最小值。两个分母各设一个新元，条件化为 $u+v=8$。","after":"rewrite","version":"ea98ad4e8c92","html":"<div class=\"method-figure\">\n      <div class=\"method-template\"><span class=\"method-node\"><small>完整分母</small><b><span class=\"hole-frac\"><span>1</span><span class=\"hole\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span></b></span><span class=\"method-arrow\"><small>令</small><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i></span><span class=\"method-node\"><small>换元</small><b><var>u</var> = <span class=\"hole\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></b></span></div>\n      <p class=\"method-demo\"><span class=\"method-demo-tag\">例</span><span class=\"method-demo-body\"><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"term square\"><math><mi>u</mi></math></span><span class=\"op\">=</span><math><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><span class=\"op\">，</span></span><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"term circle\"><math><mi>v</mi></math></span><span class=\"op\">=</span><math><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></span><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"op\">⇒</span><span class=\"term square\"><math><mi>u</mi></math></span><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"term circle\"><math><mi>v</mi></math></span><span class=\"op\">=</span><math><mn>8</mn></math></span></span></p>\n      <p class=\"method-pill\">换元后回到定和、配齐次等熟悉结构</p>\n    </div>"}
